			"date": "2023-01-09T16:39:04.863Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://social.coop/@eb\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>eb</span></a></span> sure, yeah—but does it announce page changes to screen readers? That’s the #1 accessibility issue with SPA—each plugin has had to solve this problem independently afaik</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
